Package: nepalallometry
Type: Package
Title: Allometric Estimation for Nepal's Forest Trees
Version: 0.7.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Santosh", "Ayer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ayer.sant@gmail.com")
Author: Santosh Ayer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Santosh Ayer <ayer.sant@gmail.com>
Description: Implements published species-specific allometric equations for
    forest trees in Nepal. The current development version estimates total
    aboveground biomass using equations reported by the Forest Research and
    Training Centre in 2025 and the air-dry biomass method of Sharma and
    Pukkala (1990), and the height-inclusive pantropical equation of Chave et
    al. (2014), with basic wood density from FRTC (2025) and the Global Wood
    Density Database v2.2. It provides tree-, plot-, species-, diameter-class-,
    and forest-level biomass and carbon summaries.
